GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_DesignTokenPerspectiveParallel> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_DesignTokenPerspectiveParallel> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_DesignTokenPerspectiveParallel> ;
    narr:childCount "5"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "4a2e5af44505dae82a1f0f0aac97e2348a790a70" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds that extracted design tokens and visual lenses control [AI](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_11) output fidelity the way document-extracted perspectives do. [Freya's tokenization pipeline](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_6) describes extracting a design language into tokens applied across surfaces, and [building sites from extraction alone](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_8) — output that matches initial designs without visuals, tightened only with a few. The load-bearing claim, voiced twice, is that [the lens is the unique controlling part](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_10): without input through her own lens, the output breaks. [Tanya's parallel from Northwind](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_11) grounds the analogy — she built files representing how people think, 'the equivalent of design tokens for product language,' and seeded chats with them — and [the same lens-controls-output claim recurs](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_17) in the later advisor call. The graph holds the parallel open rather than concluding the two mechanisms are identical.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_10> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_11> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_6> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_8> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_17> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "it is the lens that controls all of that." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_10> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "the equivalent of design tokens for product language" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_11> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "It doesn't look anything like a Claude website. It looks like the initial designs." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_8> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "I have a process where I extract everything that builds into a design language which gets tokenized." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_6> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Without my input through my own lens, it breaks, it falls down." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_17> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tanya's prior Northwind work suggests the token-lens mechanism predates this product, qualifying any claim that the parallel is novel here." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_11> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Freya's claim that the lens is the unique part is asserted as her own expert judgment, not demonstrated against a baseline where the lens is absent." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_10> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_17> ] ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
}